/* Story lettering (docs/decisions.md 2026-10-19, «الخط مرسوم»): the words look hand-lettered and painted into
   the picture, not typed into a box.
   - Face: Playpen Sans Arabic (SIL OFL), a rounded hand-drawn letter made for children learning to read, with
     full, clear tashkeel. Static instances only (Chromium embeds variable fonts as Type 3). It is wider than
     Noto Naskh at the same size, so `size-adjust: 90%` keeps the age sizes (26/24 pt, 21/20 pt) at about the
     visual size of the Naskh they replace. It covers Latin too: English books keep the same storybook hand.
   - "calt" off: Playpen's cross-word contextual alternates make Chromium reuse the wrong glyphs where a line
     breaks (a word vanished and another was drawn twice); `tests/test_story_type.py` guards it.
   - Ink: a deep tone of the picture's own color (--ink, ≥ 7:1 on the wash); the child's name in the theme's
     accent, darkened until it reads (--name, ≥ 4.5:1), in the heavier weight.
   Colors come per page from `render.ink_vars` (CSS variables on the page). */
@font-face { font-family: "Playpen Sans Arabic"; src: url("{{ fonts }}/PlaypenSansArabic-SemiBold.ttf") format("truetype"); font-weight: 400 700; size-adjust: 90%; }
@font-face { font-family: "Playpen Sans Arabic"; src: url("{{ fonts }}/PlaypenSansArabic-ExtraBold.ttf") format("truetype"); font-weight: 800 900; size-adjust: 90%; }

:root { --story-face: "Playpen Sans Arabic", "Noto Naskh Arabic", serif; --story-lh: 1.95; }
.story-text { font-family: var(--story-face); font-weight: 600; line-height: var(--story-lh); color: var(--ink, #1C2140); font-feature-settings: "calt" 0; }
[dir="ltr"] .story-text { font-family: var(--story-face); }
.story-text .hero-name { font-family: inherit; font-weight: 800; color: var(--name, var(--accent, #A8560A)); }
.story-text .the-end { color: var(--name, var(--accent, #A8560A)); }

/* The painted shape under text set on the art (`shapes.SHAPES_JS` draws it once the text is fitted), the
   theme's motif tucked on its corner and a hand-drawn flourish on its lower edge. */
.ink-shape { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: -1; pointer-events: none; }
.motif-tag { position: absolute; top: -8mm; inset-inline-start: -5mm; width: 24mm; height: 15.6mm; z-index: 1; transform: rotate(-8deg); }
[dir="rtl"] .motif-tag { transform: scaleX(-1) rotate(-8deg); }
.motif-tag svg, .text-flourish svg, .paper-flourish svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; }
.text-flourish { position: absolute; bottom: -2.4mm; left: 50%; width: 44mm; height: 6.1mm; margin-left: -22mm; z-index: 1; }
.text-flourish.in-flow { position: static; margin: 1.2mm auto 0; flex: none; }
.paper-flourish { position: absolute; bottom: -7.5mm; left: 50%; width: 44mm; height: 6.1mm; margin-left: -22mm; }
